<title>CANADA: Pyng Tech infusion system cleared in U.S.</title>
<headline>Pyng Tech infusion system cleared in U.S.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, B.C. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pyng Technologies Co said Friday its Pyng Medical Corp unit had received marketing clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for its F.A.S.T. 1 intraosseous infusion system.</p>
<p>Pyng said the system was cleared for use on adults in emergency medical situations.</p>
<p>The company was not available to provide further details.</p>
<p>The system was previously cleared for sale in Canada, it said.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
